5. Applications of Microprocessor
Desktop computers.
Laptops.
Servers.
Workstations.
Advanced computing systems.
6. Conclusion
A microcontroller is a small computer on one chip designed to control specific tasks, while a microprocessor is mainly a CPU designed to process information and perform general-purpose tasks.
